WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.800
When you are on the lesson page and reading,

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.500
this is a very important part of, certainly of my learning, on LingQ.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.000
I listen a lot more than I read. I listen a lot because I can do it whenever I want,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.300
in the car washing dishes and so forth, but then I want to get back to the lesson page for a mining,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:24.600
so to speak, this text for more hints about the language. Noticing things,

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.000
seeing these yellow LingQs that I've created before.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.600
Don't forget that you can adjust the font on your lesson page.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.100
You can also decide whether you want to review...

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:40.320
in the settings you can either review
your words after every page, or not do that.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:46.860
You can also set the settings so
that when you move to another page all

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:51.449
the words you didn't say won't
automatically be turned to white. So, be

00:00:51.449 --> 00:00:56.520
familiar with all the settings, and make
sure you derive the maximum benefit from

00:00:56.520 --> 00:01:01.000
working with your lesson page. That's a
big part of your learning.

